<span class="eyebrow">SIX COLORS · FOUR CHAMPIONS · TWO TREATMENTS</span><h1>One deck. Distinctive signatures.</h1><p class="intro">Can a champion’s move feel special while still reading as its card color? Compare the existing deck, the current signature illustration, and two painted treatments of the same move. Style A has been selected and extended to all 24 live signature illustrations. This page preserves the original study comparisons.</p>
<div class="study-note"><h2>Selected direction: A · monochrome</h2>Keep the fighter, scenery, and action effects within the card’s tonal palette. All 24 champion techniques now use this direction, without contrasting accent streaks. <a href="adventure/technique-art.php">View the applied set →</a></div>
